      "chunk_text": "Rohan Ahuja called about a delayed refund for his cancelled home policy HP-001234. He was promised a 3\u20115 business\u2011day turnaround, but a week had passed. Agent Sunita Agarwal apologized, identified a processing issue, escalated it, and assured the refund would arrive within two business days. She also confirmed the policy was cancelled effective the previous week and that no further bills will be issued. The customer thanked her and ended the call.",
